------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications from upstream Ketcher
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files have been modified from the upstream Ketcher
distribution (https://github.com/epam/ketcher):

  - packages/ketcher-core/src/infrastructure/services/helpers.ts
      Defensive guard added around ketcherProvider.getKetcher() in
      getLabelRenderModeForIndigo() to tolerate missing editor
      instances during headless rendering.

  - packages/ketcher-core/src/infrastructure/services/struct/remoteStructService.ts
      Same defensive guard in pickStandardServerOptions().

  - packages/ketcher-standalone/src/infrastructure/services/struct/standaloneStructService.ts
      Headless-mode branch added to getStandardServerOptions() returning
      sane defaults when no editor instance is bound.

The following new workspace has been added:

  - packages/ketcher-web-component (this package)
      Custom-element wrapper for framework-agnostic consumption of
      Ketcher (Angular, Vue, plain HTML).

